# Relay desktop UI catalog, Portuguese, Brazil (pt-BR), section: Background (stay available with no window, call alert, answer automatically). Same ids and $variables as localizations/en/background.ftl. See docs/i18n.md.

background-label = Continuar disponível em segundo plano
